<div style="text-align: left;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 24px;">
        Reset Your Password
    </h2>
    
    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        Hi {{name}},
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6;">
        We received a request to reset the password for your account. If you made this request, please use the following security code to proceed:
    </p>

    <div style="background-color: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <span style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 4px; color: #1e40af;">{{token}}</span>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        This code will expire in 15 minutes.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 8px;">
        If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.
    </p>
</div>